OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FChilly but
OL,6,Fincreasingly cloudy though the
OL,7,Fevening, as outbreaks of light rain
OL,8,Farrive from the west on strengthening
OL,9,Fwinds. Rain becoming heavy and
OL,10,Fpersistent overnight, with winds
OL,11,Fbecoming strong. Minimum Temperature
OL,12,F3C.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FA cloudy and wet day as
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain, which may be heavy
OL,16,Fat times, move northeastward. Strong
OL,17,Fwinds throughout, but milder than
OL,18,FSunday. Maximum Temperature 12C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
