OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FSunny
OL,6,Fintervals and showers but chilly on
OL,7,FTuesday and Wednesday, with a fresh
OL,8,Fbreeze on Tuesday. Cloudy with rain
OL,9,Fand windy again Thursday.
